# contracted_det.voc — Contracted preposition+article forms (do/no/ao/num …). They introduce
# locative/partitive PPs, NOT direct objects — so score_verb does NOT count them
# as a DET-after object signal. Shared by the colher/verb-object checks.
#
# Format: one term per line, lowercase; '#' starts a comment.

ao
aos
da
das
do
dos
na
nas
no
nos
num
numa
numas
nuns
à
às
